{"product_id":"pod-salt-freebase-red-apple-ice","title":"Pod Salt Freebase - Red Apple Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003ePod Salt Core Freebase Red Apple Ice offers a delightfully classic and fresh vaping experience, with crisp red apples delivering signature sweetness in every puff. Enhanced by a cooling ice breeze, this blend is perfected with our award-winning freebase, providing a smooth and satisfying finish. Available in 3mg and 6mg nicotine strengths, the Gorilla bottle ensures leak-free refilling and a smooth, flavorful vape with every puff.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour Profile: Red Apple with a Cool Breeze\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60ml Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 3mg \u0026amp; 6mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCooling Effect: Light menthol icy finish\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"3MG","offer_id":41991071858743,"sku":"Pod S - Red Apple Ice - 3 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6MG","offer_id":41991071891511,"sku":"Pod S - Red Apple Ice - 6 MG","price":1699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-freebase-eliquid-red-apple-ice.webp?v=1763437944","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/pod-salt-freebase-red-apple-ice","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




